 "text": "Hi! How's life treating you? About six months before the event. That gives you enough time to book tickets and sort out travel. Then they usually fill up fast. I'd book month or two ahead. Email is fine for informal invitations. Just ask first, some people still prefer the post. Then ask her to frame it. A card with everyone's name is the main thing. Keep them short, a few sentences about why you' inviting them, and a clear date. A separate reminder a week before helps too.",
